{"name":"Light in the Dark — AI Advisory Pipeline v2","nodes":[{"id":"018b0927-43cc-479c-a4b1-d0f8f180d00c","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-832,-208],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":784,"content":"## Light in the Dark — AI Advisory Pipeline v2\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives a client intake submission through a webhook, immediately acknowledges the form, and sends the client a confirmation email. It then sends the intake content to Groq to generate an AI advisory response, evaluates whether the case is urgent, and notifies Cyrus through the appropriate email path. After the internal notification, it sends the generated AI response back to the client.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the webhook URL in the intake form and ensure the submitted fields match the expressions used by downstream email and AI nodes.\n- Add Gmail credentials for the confirmation, internal notification, and client response email nodes.\n- Configure the Groq API request with a valid API key, model, endpoint, headers, and prompt/body mapping.\n- Review the urgency condition in the IF node so it correctly detects urgent cases from the AI response or intake data.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the Groq prompt/model, change the urgency rules, and edit the confirmation, internal notification, and AI response email templates."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"998c0207-f16f-4f1d-8fc2-24daa20df604","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-272,-208],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":688,"content":"## Receive and acknowledge intake\n\nHandles the incoming form submission, returns a webhook response, and sends an immediate confirmation email to the client. These nodes form the left-side intake cluster around the webhook."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3cd49d7f-36f3-4d59-b13f-14bbd35ff512","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[192,16],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":336,"content":"## Generate and classify advice\n\nCalls Groq to produce the AI advisory response, then checks whether the situation should be treated as urgent. This central cluster continues the main processing path from the intake."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8effcc87-39a9-4d14-9692-de7af55c7c82","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[672,-160],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":640,"content":"## Notify and send response\n\nBranches into urgent or standard Gmail notifications to Cyrus, then converges to send the AI-generated response to the client. These nodes form the right-side notification and delivery cluster."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"6f2c0ef9-f5ca-4f87-989f-fc8d1d3f6750","name":"When Intake Form Submitted","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-224,192],"webhookId":"316e9857-69f7-435b-8b95-b25395600d9d","parameters":{"path":"intake-form","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST","responseMode":"responseNode"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"8351d733-8063-4e62-a303-fb1a3f06cc8f","name":"Respond to Intake Submission","type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","position":[0,0],"parameters":{"options":{},"respondWith":"json","responseBody":"={\"status\": \"received\", \"message\": \"Your intake has been received. You will hear from us within 24 hours.\"}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1ea6dd4e-acb8-42da-a664-da0870da50a9","name":"Email Confirmation to Client","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[0,320],"webhookId":"8cb1a652-cbfa-4fc0-9c3b-b8c7c43d78c0","parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ ('When Intake Form Submitted').item.json.body.email ","message":"= ('When Intake Form Submitted').item.json.body.service === 'crisis-light' ? `<!DOCTYPE html><html><body><p>Emergency Advisory Received.</p></body></html>` : `<!DOCTYPE html><html><body><p>Intake Received.</p></body></html>` }}"},"typeVersion":1}],"connections":{"When Intake Form Submitted":{"main":[[{"node":"Respond to Intake Submission","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Email Confirmation to Client","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}